WEBVTT

00:04:29.496 --> 00:04:32.663
the fossilized remains
of Stone Age humans.

00:04:33.288 --> 00:04:38.496
And you can tell an awful lot from a
fossil, but behavior doesn't fossilize.

00:04:39.038 --> 00:04:44.954
So Leakey was actually ahead of his time
in thinking that way back when there

00:04:44.954 --> 00:04:47.746
was a common ancestor,
ape like, human like.

00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:53.996
And maybe that behavior has been brought
with us through our separate evolutionary

00:04:53.996 --> 00:05:00.913
pathways. So it gave him a better feeling
for how early humans might have behaved.